  "description": "BUCKLE UP, THIS IS DOWN-COUNTRY REFINED.\nCall it what you will - a trail riding heavy hitting cross-country bike, or a lightning fast trail bike, either way, LINEFINDER is a thoroughly modern, highly efficient, supremely capable rocket that’s made to go fast & rip hard.\n120mm of fully-active four bar linkage tuned rear suspension paired with a 130 or 140mm fork up front provides supremely confident descending and climbs like a goat. Because not all trails point downhill but we always like to go fast, LINEFINDER is as much fun on the pedal heavy parts as it is on the gnarly bits.\nQuality design and construction make it perfect for the long haul.\nBIKE SPECS\n\nBUILD KIT\n\nSRAM X01\n\nFRAME\n\nLINEFINDER CARBON 120MM\n\nREAR SHOCK\n\nFOX FLOAT X2 2POS TRUNION\n\nFORK\n\nFOX FLOAT 34 K 130MM FIT4 44MM\n\nHANDLEBAR\n\nPRO TAPER STEALTH 800X1\"\n\nSTEM\n\nPRO TAPER STEALTH 50X35MM\n\nSEATPOST\n\nRS Reverb AXS XPLR\n\nSADDLE\n\nSELLE ITALIA MODEL Y\n\nGRIPS\n\nPROTAPER MTB MEAT HAMMER\n\nSHIFTER\n\nSRAM EAGLE AXS\n\nREAR DERAILLEUR\n\nSRAM X01 EAGLE AXS\n\nCRANKSET\n\nSRAM X01 EAGLE BOOST LUNAR\n\nCASSETTE\n\nSRAM XG1295 EAGLE 10-52T\n\nCHAIN\n\nSRAM X01 EAGLE 12spd\n\nBRAKES\n\nMAGURA MT5 HC\n\nBRAKE ROTORS\n\nMAGURA STORM 180MM\n\nWHEELSET\n\nDT SWISS XRC1501 SPLINE 29 CARBON\n\nFRONT TIRE\n\nVITTORIA SYERRA 29X2.4\n\nREAR TIRE\n\nVITTORIA SYERRA 29X2.4\n\nHEADSET\n\nFSA NO.69 SRS LINEFINDER\n\nBOTTOM BRACKET\n\nSRAM DUB T47",
